{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Void Corridors</strong> is a first-person puzzle horror game where you navigate a maze-like environment, solve intricate puzzles, and manage limited resources to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Keep your flashlight powered by scavenging energy, and maintain the generator to keep the corridors lit. Every second of light counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzle Solving</strong> \u2013 Encounter a variety of environmental puzzles that unlock new areas, reveal hidden secrets, and help you progress deeper into the corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udeaa <strong>Exploration &amp; Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Roam through dark, shifting corridors illuminated by an eerie glow. Pay attention to your surroundings\u2014sometimes, it feels like the environment itself changes when you're not looking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 The deeper you go, the stronger the sensation of being watched. Unravel the mystery behind the corridors before the presence lurking in the shadows finds you.<br><br><strong>Will you uncover the truth, or become lost in the void?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Power Play","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504960/6c97724acd09ce4c671d904f88637c002ba6ca27.jpg"},{"name":"USB","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504960/6eaba589071894701d0d441310b4ac090ab2b414.jpg"},{"name":"Byte by Byte","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504960/4c89f2a65ff856eef0d6ba63e75d036401a8af13.jpg"},{"name":"Secrets Unveiled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504960/45f498ef024fc2e81827ef9547ec6d99540dece3.jpg"},{"name":"